# Replying two ways: A for the quick replies, Y for the on-screen keyboard, and the toast the
# send leaves behind. `message out` stands in for the radio's echo - the store only raises the
# SEND action, and there is no app or radio behind this harness to carry it out.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 130

hold 500
key down 4
key a
hold 700
# A opens the canned list over the thread: one more press sends the row under the cursor.
key a
hold 900
key b
hold 500
# Y skips it and types instead, so B here lands back on the conversation, not on the list.
key y
hold 700
key down
key right 8
key a
hold 400
key down
key left
key a
hold 700
key start
message out BRVO ok
toast Sent to BRVO
hold 1500
